source('usbr-stepped','階梯溢洪道水力設計指引','Guidelines for Hydraulic Design of Stepped Spillways','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/hydraulics_lab/pubs/HL/HL-2015-06.pdf','已取回2015年原始指引，包含流態、階高、含氣、邊牆與氣蝕議題；本課數值並非其設計範例。','Retrieved the 2015 original guide covering regimes, step geometry, aeration, walls and cavitation; lesson quantities are not its design examples.')
source('usbr-fontenelle-model','方特內爾壩側槽水力模型報告','Fontenelle Dam spillway hydraulic model studies','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/hydraulics_lab/pubs/HYD/HYD-486.pdf','已取回1962年雙側槽、陡槽與消能池試驗報告，用於比較模型驗證流程，不移植其設計參數。','Retrieved the 1962 double-side-channel, chute and basin study; used to compare validation methods without transplanting design parameters.')
source('usbr-research-catalog','美國墾務局水工研究報告目錄','Reclamation engineering research report catalog','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/recercreports.html','官方目錄核實1987年Upper Stillwater階梯溢洪道研究及1971年Yellowtail摻氣研究，僅作技術文件時間軸。','Official catalog verifies the 1987 Upper Stillwater stepped-spillway and 1971 Yellowtail aeration studies; used as publication chronology only.')
source('usbr-monticello','蒙蒂塞洛壩與鐘口溢洪道業主資料','Monticello Dam and morning-glory spillway owner facts','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/mp/ccao/berryessa/vsp/facts.html','業主確認Monticello鐘口型溢洪道與1957年建壩；課程幾何水頭均另行假設，不以公開庫容作演算。','Owner confirms the morning-glory spillway and 1957 dam construction; course geometry and heads are assumed, and public storage is not used in calculations.')
source('usbr-spillwaypro','溢洪道氣蝕與摻氣分析官方資料','Official spillway cavitation and aeration analysis resources','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/computer%20software/software/EM42/index.html','已讀官方頁，確認EM42氣蝕專論與2021年平滑及階梯槽功能更新；未宣稱軟體結果能取代實體驗證。','Read the official page confirming EM42 and the 2021 smooth/stepped-chute update; software results are not presented as substitutes for physical validation.')
source('usace-hss','美國陸軍工兵團水工鋼構設計手冊','USACE design of hydraulic steel structures','U.S. Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.publications.usace.army.mil/USACE-Publications/Engineer-Manuals/u43544q/32313037/','官方索引核實EM1110-2-2107及2022年出版日期；PDF直接取回受限，僅用可查證索引與主題，不聲稱讀過全文。','Official index verifies EM1110-2-2107 and its 2022 publication; direct PDF access was restricted, so full-text review is not claimed.')
source('usbr-radial','弧形閘門正常運轉失效機制','Failure of radial gates under normal operating conditions','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/damsafety/risk/BestPractices/Chapters/G1-FailureOfRadial-Tainter-GatesUnderNormalOperationalConditions.pdf','官方原始風險章節核實弧形閘門配置與失效路徑，算例不是任何真實閘門設計荷載。','Official original risk chapter identifies radial-gate arrangement and failure paths; example loads do not describe any real gate.')
source('usbr-waterstop','壩體收縮縫止水修復研究','Dam contraction-joint waterstop repair research','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/research/projects/detail.cfm?id=3191','原始研究頁說明收縮縫運動造成既有金屬止水劣化及修復需求；不把研究成果當作現場保證。','Original project page describes joint motion, metal-waterstop deterioration and repair needs; research is not a field-performance guarantee.')
source('usbr-waterstop-collab','收縮縫滲漏修復合作研究','Contraction-joint leak repair collaboration','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/research/projects/detail.cfm?id=7688','官方研究頁核實深水修復材料遞送與接縫止水議題；課程施工算例為原創假設。','Official research page verifies underwater repair delivery and joint-waterstop topics; construction examples are original assumptions.')
source('usace-gates','美國陸軍工兵團壩安全技術入口','USACE dam safety technical resources','U.S. Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.usace.army.mil/Missions/Civil-Works/Dam-Safety-Program/Program-Activities/','官方入口列有垂直升降閘門EM1110-2-2701等技術資料，作為閘門查核脈絡。','Official portal lists Vertical Lift Gates EM1110-2-2701 and related resources for gate-verification context.')
