source('sika-waterstops','西卡聚氯乙烯止水帶與接縫型式','Sika PVC waterstops and joint types','Sika','https://usa.sika.com/en/construction/concrete/concrete-accessories/waterstop-systems/pvc-waterstop.html','已讀製造商頁面，核對活動與非活動接縫、型式與材料適用性；不宣稱供應任何本課工程，證券資料未查核。','Read the manufacturer page for moving and nonmoving joints and material/profile applicability; no project supply role or verified security listing is claimed.')
source('eth-bypass','蘇黎世聯邦理工水工模型研究目錄','ETH Zurich hydraulic model research catalog','ETH Zurich','https://vaw.ethz.ch/en/research/hydraulic-engineering/completed-projects.html','已讀原始研究目錄，核實Solis繞庫排砂模型及Palagnedra磨耗研究脈絡；算例不是其量測值。','Read the original research catalog confirming Solis bypass modeling and Palagnedra abrasion context; examples are not their measurements.')
source('pwri-sediment','日本土木研究所水工與輸砂實驗室','PWRI hydraulics and sediment transport laboratory','Public Works Research Institute','https://www.pwri.go.jp/team/dam_hydraulic/english.htm','官方研究頁說明洪水繞庫排砂、含砂水與縮尺試驗限制；不把實驗比例當本課設計值。','Official laboratory page describes flood sediment bypass, turbid flow and physical-model limits; laboratory scales are not course design inputs.')
source('mlit-miwa','日本國土交通省美和壩繞庫排砂','MLIT Miwa Dam sediment bypass','Ministry of Land Infrastructure Transport and Tourism','https://www.cbr.mlit.go.jp/tendamu/dam/bypass/miwa.html','官方原始頁核實美和繞庫隧道與試驗運轉歷程；僅用作排砂途徑比較，無工程參數移植。','Official page verifies Miwa bypass and its trial-operation history; used for pathway comparison without transplanting parameters.')
source('epfl-venting','洛桑聯邦理工異重流排砂研究','EPFL turbidity-current venting research','EPFL','https://infoscience.epfl.ch/entities/publication/73141485-744c-4dce-9040-5e8e21807c67','官方典藏索引核實2016年異重流排砂原始研究；全文直取回傳429，未宣稱全文閱讀。','Official repository index verifies the 2016 venting research; full-text retrieval returned429 and is not claimed.')
source('epfl-timing','異重流排砂操作時機原始研究','Original research on venting timing','EPFL','https://infoscience.epfl.ch/record/259178/files/2018-1275%20Chamoun_DeCesare_Schleiss_Influence%20of%20Operational%20Timing%20on%20the%20Efficiency%20of%20Venting%20Turbidity%20Currents.pdf','官方典藏搜尋核實2018年時機與效率研究；直接PDF受限，僅據可見摘要及書目界定主題。','Official repository search verifies the 2018 timing and efficiency study; direct PDF access was restricted, so only visible abstract and bibliographic scope are used.')
source('epfl-rudbar','魯德巴爾洛雷斯坦水庫排砂模型研究','Rudbar-Lorestan reservoir venting model study','EPFL','https://infoscience.epfl.ch/bitstreams/da9bfcaf-0693-44e1-a694-4391ff2edf7c/download','官方典藏摘要核實具名水庫的異重流排砂研究，非實際運轉成效保證；直取全文受限。','Official repository abstract verifies the named reservoir venting investigation, not guaranteed operational performance; full-text access was restricted.')
source('usbr-rsem','美國墾務局水庫泥砂經濟模型','Reclamation reservoir sedimentation economics model','Bureau of Reclamation','https://www.usbr.gov/tsc/techreferences/computer%20software/models/rsem/index.html','2023年RSEM技術報告第2.2節的Muddy水庫為虛構經濟模型算例；官方索引另列Muddy Creek抽泥與排砂示範，不視為已實作工程。模型不代替詳細水理、輸砂與經濟研究。','Section 2.2 of the 2023 RSEM technical report describes Muddy Reservoir as a hypothetical economic-model example. The official index lists Muddy Creek dredging and sluicing demonstrations, not verified constructed projects. Detailed hydraulic, sediment and economic investigations remain necessary.')
source('usace-millsite','米爾賽特水庫抽泥提案公告','Millsite Reservoir suction-dredging proposal notice','U.S. Army Corps of Engineers','https://www.spk.usace.army.mil/Media/Regulatory-Public-Notices/Article/3355786/spk-2013-00240-public-notice-of-permit-application-for-the-millsite-reservoir-r/','官方申請公告描述吸泥與浮管輸送，僅為擬議方案，不聲稱施工完成或已有許可。','Official application notice describes suction dredging and floating pipelines as proposed work; completion or permit approval is not asserted.')
source('usace-sediment-workshop','水庫泥砂管理與分析技術說明','Reservoir sediment management and analysis technical note','U.S. Army Corps of Engineers','https://erdc-library.erdc.dren.mil/bitstreams/9faf515c-e109-48e8-aeb0-b54d325d312d/download','官方2019年技術說明核實泥砂策略、疏浚、沖砂與環境整合分析主題；不將案例資料當教學設計輸入。','Official 2019 technical note verifies integrated sediment strategy, dredging, flushing and environmental analysis; case data are not teaching design inputs.')
